<newsitem itemid="154953" id="root" date="1996-10-30" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Betterware H1 pretax profits rise 63 pct.</title>
<headline>Betterware H1 pretax profits rise 63 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>28 weeks to September 14</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		3.4		    vs 2.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.00		   vs 0.85</p>
<p> Pretax		     6.7		    vs 4.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   32.1		   vs 27.6</p>
<p> Operating profit	 5.02		   vs 4.30</p>
<p> Exceptional gain	 1.25		   vs nil</p>
<p> Pay date		   Jan 3</p>
<p>Div registration date  Nov 19</p>
<p>NOTE - Betterware Plc, which sells household goods by catalogue, said that the second half has started well and trading remains ahead of last year.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
